00:00:27.310 --> 00:00:29.510
Gathering Flower Power!

00:00:37.680 --> 00:00:43.570
Dark Tact, the power of the dark, and the dark power of the dark, Fortesmo!

00:01:11.070 --> 00:01:13.800
The legendary warrior Precure has been defeated.

00:01:13.800 --> 00:01:16.910
With this, my heart's metabolism will be drained.

00:01:16.910 --> 00:01:20.200
