00:04:08.280 --> 00:04:10.210
My name is Tsubomi Hanasaki.

00:04:10.750 --> 00:04:17.730
My father and mother opened a flower shop in Kibouga-Hanashi, where my grandmother lived, and I moved here.

00:04:21.450 --> 00:04:25.740
I'm embarrassed to move here.

00:04:26.380 --> 00:04:30.000
But when the weather gets better, I want to change my personality.

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:33.250
I will change it.

00:04:33.250 --> 00:04:40.360
It's a four-leaf clover.

00:04:40.360 --> 00:04:42.930
Flower language is happiness.

00:04:42.930 --> 00:04:46.100
Clover, please fulfill my wish.

00:04:46.100 --> 00:04:48.820
All right.

00:05:04.320 --> 00:05:05.650
I'll change myself!

00:05:05.650 --> 00:05:07.200
I'll change myself!

00:05:07.200 --> 00:05:22.820
I'll introduce you to my new friends.

00:05:22.820 --> 00:05:24.580
Hanasaki-san, come in.

00:05:24.580 --> 00:05:25.840
